skills/dsh-qa/SKILL.md:102:| surface-pin | W7 surfaces | a FULLY OFFLINE declaration pin over the shipped sources (no dsh, no credentials, no sandbox, no evidence directory): it parses every `registerTool({…})` / `registerCommand({…})` block out of the four packages that the autoproject refactor changed and asserts, file by file, that `mpd_autoproject` exists WITH its `scope` parameter while `mpd_ulw`/`mpd_ultrawork` are GONE anywhere in the tree; that `/autoproject` is registered and `/ulw` + `/ultrawork` are not; that the five `agent_teams_*` names are unchanged with the wave's new verbs (`task{context,handoff}`, `control{fence,unfence}`, `dispatch{mode,reassign}`); that all fifteen `cellwork_*` names survive including the NEW `cellwork_open`; that `mpd_workmate_optimize` / `mpd_workmate_persona_set` / `/workmate-optimize` exist; that `mpd_memory_write|read|status` declare `scope` and `mpd_memory_read` declares `offset` and returns `next_offset`. **THE CROSS-PACKAGE PIN (the memory reviewer's M1):** the global-memory archive hook couples to three producers by STRUCTURAL STRING KEYS, so the SAME case asserts the key NAMES on BOTH sides in one process — the boulder completion's `workId`, the accepted cell stop's `{ok, cellId}`, the plan delete's `archivedTo`, and the archived-plan listing's `planId`/`path` (optional `approvedAt`/`teamId`) on the producer side, and the hook's own `value?.workId` / `value?.ok === false` / `value?.cellId` / `value?.archivedTo` / `plan.approvedAt` / `plan.teamId` / `plan.planId` reads plus its `ArchivedPlanView` on the consumer side — a rename on either side reddens HERE instead of silently turning the hook into a no-op. The block scanner skips strings AND comments, because the plan tool's own output schema spells braces inside comments. `--self-test` is offline: it drives every predicate against a fixture, then against the SHIPPED tree (which must pass), then EIGHT negative controls — a renamed parameter, a removed action verb, a re-added alias TOOL, a re-added alias COMMAND, a renamed cellwork tool, a producer output key removed (with an assertion that the mutation really applied), a consumer-side read renamed, and a renamed command — each of which must redden | W7 |
